    <briefdescription>
<para>State-machine IVR engine driven by DTMF and/or speech input. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Nodes are added with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_ivr_engine_1a48ddee04b4167e50af70fdcb0bb7ff6d" kindref="member">addNode()</ref>; the active node is advanced via <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_ivr_engine_1a359c32d4a9cd86ceb542ebd13b261cad" kindref="member">handleDtmf()</ref> or <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_ivr_engine_1a5696885664bf6293633c8340d5aeeb89" kindref="member">handleSpeech()</ref>. The TTS prompt for each node is returned so the caller can pipe it to the call&apos;s synthesizeTts().</para>
